	0
			/----RE-ENTER HERE TO REFRESH----
QARFSH,	LDA I		/INITIAL Y POSITION
277
	STC QAH-1
	SET I 3		/XR3 TO PTR TO HALFWORD QUESTIONS-1
	0
	SET 5		/XR5 TO PTR TO LAST DISPLAYED CHAR IN ANSWER BUFR
