	ADD QAW		/NOP IN AC
	JMP QAM
	LDH I 3		/BUMP PTR
	LDA I
	BSE I
	STC QAM+2	/SET INSTR TO SET FF FOR FULL SIZE
	ADD QAW+1	/ADD 9U IN AC
QAM,	STC QAP+3
	MSC I 4		/EAD CONTROL REGISTER
